  {
   "key": "0x01",
   "name": "vck_callback",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:OKI-VoiceSynthesis-1994.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1228-1230"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.h",
     "function": "msm5205_device::vck_callback"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
     "function": "msm5205_device::device_clock_changed"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
     "function": "msm5205_device::toggle_vck"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A pin, terminal 14 with its name lost in the capture, is listed as an output (the capture reads `14 0`).",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:OKI-VoiceSynthesis-1994.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1228",
       "sha": "d79fd5acc29ebbe818c716ca8c42c62c6603198cde3202ec906139b8143b4249"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2A",
     "on": "read",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "That pin outputs a signal.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:OKI-VoiceSynthesis-1994.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1229-1230",
       "sha": "e8232968999fdc70d89079a0c4bca07e45078a30d682df9c923da1eaa2761942"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2B",
     "on": "read",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The frequency of that signal equals the sampling frequency selected by the S1 and S2 inputs.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:OKI-VoiceSynthesis-1994.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1229-1230",
       "sha": "e8232968999fdc70d89079a0c4bca07e45078a30d682df9c923da1eaa2761942"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "101",
     "on": "place",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "place",
     "text": "MAME hands the driver the VCK output through vck_callback, a binder for a write-line callback that toggle_vck calls with the new level.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.h",
       "lines": "31",
       "sha": "3cd15f673e29d91cab08f400f670ee2807aaf74a41ce828f6576c391ae1178ae"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
       "lines": "169",
       "sha": "d1a5d12ff44a88edf35be60c3f82a199b6c01a70cbaeb7eafcdc39623ebe0fc3"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.h",
       "lines": "83",
       "sha": "2c6b89579fea0a647cc101335430170cb4621561c3a67dd08a26e0a30c73ec57"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "102",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With prescaler 0, MAME logs VCK slave mode and stops its VCK timer.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
       "lines": "329-330",
       "sha": "9a3f4644de572597b64ecb5c429feb6d6ae474b7a948a230beeff16a21296f15"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
       "lines": "338-341",
       "sha": "141e8712d5f464982e91dfe6492ccea1556e55ae2bc58de0f8cc22877699f13a"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "103",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "On a falling edge of VCK, toggle_vck schedules the data capture with the capture divisor, 6 clocks in this class.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
       "lines": "170-171",
       "sha": "a9b0e3075afa87c7bf1bdc4bdd3498049c65a688ccf275937f22d9d782401261"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.h",
       "lines": "66",
       "sha": "153ae17fd2e5ace0d486abf03fd2afebc2db3232ba08f8c63ce81e22940b9db1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "closed": [
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/msm5205.cpp",
     "lines": "334-335",
     "as": "unfollowed",
     "row": "2B"
    },
    {
