     "where": "bitsavers",
     "gave": "Hosts OKI's 1994 voice synthesis data book, the document used here; it names no such handler."
    },
    {
     "where": "archive-org",
     "gave": "Holds an archived copy of the same data book; nothing else was looked for there."
    },
    {
